  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5503.03 Division’s Responsibilities.\n\n(a) The division shall establish and maintain a registry of individuals required to register pursuant to RSA 651-B.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of the copy of the DSSP 311, the division shall:\n\n(1) Enter the information into the SOR database; and\n\n(2) Pursuant to RSA 651-B:3, forward a copy to the local law enforcement agency or appropriate out-of-state law enforcement agency having jurisdiction over the place the sexual offender or offender against children expects to reside upon discharge.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99, EXPIRED: 7-28-07\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12); ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
